{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年22歲的香港「網球一哥」黃澤林，剛結束與歌神陳奕迅愛女陳康堤短短半年的戀情，隨即火速爆出撻着譚旻萱（Mandy），被指「無縫交接」。</p><p>為此黃澤林早前在網台交代新舊戀情：「9月已經分開咗，當時係佢（康堤）提出分手，分手原因完全無關第三者介入</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:04:02.874674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:38:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:14.389002+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:14.389002+00:00","content_hash":"166d5d7de11a49d116ba301e32370ae2ec69df26753a78b39c6d570a908caa50","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}